This prohibition includes, but is not limited to:

* training, pre-training, fine-tuning, or improving any AI or machine learning model;
* reinforcement learning or reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF);
* model distillation;
* transfer learning;
* supervised, unsupervised, self-supervised, or semi-supervised learning;
* creation of datasets or benchmark datasets;
* evaluation, testing, alignment, optimization, or calibration of AI systems;
* generation of embeddings or vector representations;
* indexing into vector databases or retrieval systems;
* retrieval-augmented generation (RAG);
* synthetic data generation;
* automated code analysis intended to improve machine learning systems;
* extraction of patterns, statistics, metadata, or semantic information for use in AI systems;
* use by autonomous coding assistants or similar systems for learning or model improvement.

This prohibition applies whether the Software is used:

* in whole or in part;
* modified or unmodified;
* manually or automatically;
* commercially, academically, personally, or by any governmental or non-profit organization.

No license is granted for any AI- or machine-learning-related activity.

